# Bounded generated map/select assignment diagnostics (jq.test:1273/1277).
try ((map(select(.a == 1))[].b) = 10) catch .
[{"a":0},{"a":1}]
"Invalid path expression near attempt to iterate through [{\"a\":1}]"

try ((map(select(.a == 1))[].a) |= .+1) catch .
[{"a":0},{"a":1}]
"Invalid path expression near attempt to iterate through [{\"a\":1}]"

try ((map(select(.a == 1))[].b) = 10) catch .
[]
"Invalid path expression near attempt to iterate through []"

try ((map(select(.a == 1))[].a) |= .+1) catch .
null
"Cannot iterate over null (null)"

try ((map(select(.a == 1))[].b) = 10) catch .
1
"Cannot iterate over number (1)"
